  "categories": [
    {
      "title": "SUMMER-ENHANCING PEOPLE",
      "featuredImage": "https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/1351/1351220/images/a3c9ac5036ff55cc5d4ebfdb3c6c034f7f448c09.png",
      "featuredImageLink": "https://www.jacquemus.com",
      "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 150%;\">\"My name is Simon, I like blue and white, stripes, the sun, fruits, circles, life, poetry, Marseille and the 80s\" reads the bio of fashion phenomenon Simon Porte Jacquemus, who grew up in the French countryside with one of his biggest inspirations: his grandmother <a href=\"https://www.jacquemus.com\" style=\"color: #2664F6; text-decoration: underline;\">Liline</a>.</p> <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 150%;\">There are few brands as committed to the amplification of the good life as Poolsuite, but Simon comes pretty close. In anticipation of his latest collection \"LE PAPIER\" launching on 27th June <em>somewhere special</em> and featuring pieces from his newest collaboration with <a href=\"https://www.nike.com\" style=\"color: #2664F6; text-decoration: underline;\">Nike</a>.</p> <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 150%;\">\"I was born in the 90s, the decade of techno and technology. But I grew up so naïve. My weekly highlight was to sell fruits and vegetables on the road-side on weekends with my grandparents.\"</p></p>",
      "additionalImages": [
        {
          "url": "https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/1351/1351220/images/cac0057b4398437817ad13887c281acb3737a171.png",
          "alt": "Jacquemus collection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "SUMMER-ENHANCING VEHICLES",
      "featuredImage": "https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/1351/1351220/images/ef7860d989424d7c07172936ea1a096c28b481af.gif",
      "featuredImageLink": "https://www.meyers-manx.com",
      "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 150%;\">The Meyers Manx 2.0 EV: Bruce Meyers' iconic 1960s dune buggy reimagined for the electric age. The original Manx was born from a love of the beach and freedom — this new version keeps that spirit alive while adding modern performance.</p> <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 150%;\">Also featured: The <a href=\"https://www.lamborghini.com\" style=\"color: #2664F6; text-decoration: underline;\">Lamborghini Countach LPI 800-4</a> in all its wedge-shaped glory, proving that some designs are truly timeless.</p></p>",
      "additionalImages": [
        {
          "url": "https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/1351/1351220/images/922ea943f8ce725f4204ff4767fab484eff6f4cc.png",
          "alt": "Meyers Manx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "SUMMER-ENHANCING PLACES",
      "featuredImage": "https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/1351/1351220/images/a4103963f734a6cb63af4ed3c620b1fea8386aea.gif",
      "featuredImageLink": "https://www.paradiso-ibiza.com",
      "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 150%;\">Paradiso Ibiza Art Hotel: Where art meets the Mediterranean. Every corner is designed for that perfect Instagram moment, but more importantly, for genuine relaxation and inspiration.</p> <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 150%;\">The hotel features works from over 100 artists and a rooftop pool overlooking the old town. It's become the unofficial headquarters for the creative class during Ibiza season.</p></p>",
      "additionalImages": [
        {
          "url": "https://bucket.mlcdn.com/a/1351/1351220/images/703651b2be22f80865d6ae123e33a4c19acb45f4.png",
          "alt": "Paradiso Ibiza"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
